Design: ~/dev/io-k8s-p5/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-03-crd-design.md (D12). Kubernetes::REST ticket 24 adds a with => [...] constructor argument that mirrors IO::K8s and passes the cluster OpenAPI spec through. OCP::Kubernetes::register_resource_providers ($api->k8s->add(@RESOURCE_PROVIDERS)) then becomes a with => [qw(IO::K8s::Cilium IO::K8s::CertManager IO::K8s::GatewayAPI)] at construction; the comment above @RESOURCE_PROVIDERS describes exactly the hole that closes. Bump the cpanfile pins to the releases that ship it. Depends on: kubernetes-rest 24.

Erledigt im Zuge von k132 (Commit a080642): register_resource_providers stellt die drei Provider jetzt ueber die durable Kubernetes::REST with-Liste (1.108/D12-Modell) statt ueber das fluechtige $api->k8s->add() bereit; OCP::Cmd::Apply::K8s teilt denselben Pfad. Der externe Blocker (kubernetes-rest with-Konstruktor) war mit 1.108 bereits erfuellt.
